    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Lower back pain and stiffness; no other joint pain</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No leg weakness, numbness, tingling, or saddle numbness</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Good stream, emptying fully, no burning, no blood</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Bowels normal; no incontinence</td></tr><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever, chills, or weight loss</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>No restlessness; no thoughts of suicide or of harming anyone</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>6 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
